WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.381
Capture Studio.

00:00:01.541 --> 00:00:04.826
Your free, private workspace for the pages worth saving.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.499
First, unzip the download.

00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:11.243
Open Chrome’s extensions page and turn on Developer mode.

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:15.819
Click Load unpacked, choose the extracted folder, and pin Capture Studio.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:23.129
Open a page and choose how much to capture: the full page, the visible area, or a selected region.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.507
Keep the page active while capture runs.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.201
Capturing a long email?

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.174
Auto can find the reading pane.

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:35.411
To pick a different area, choose scrolling area, click Full page, then select the message.

00:00:35.571 --> 00:00:38.643
Capture Studio stitches that pane from start to finish.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.791
Make your point with arrows, highlights, text, or numbered steps.

00:00:42.951 --> 00:00:45.597
For sensitive details, use solid Redact.

00:00:45.757 --> 00:00:47.826
You can undo and redo as you go.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:54.239
For a PDF, Auto suggests a paper size and orientation.

00:00:54.399 --> 00:00:59.562
Choose a standard size, or use Image-sized for one continuous page per capture part.

00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:00.789
Then export.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.137
Need a smaller image?

00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:07.009
Choose JPEG or WebP, then adjust the size or quality.

00:01:07.169 --> 00:01:11.073
Check export size shows the actual file size before you save.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:15.889
For an existing PDF, try Optimize to keep text and vectors.

00:01:16.049 --> 00:01:21.830
Rasterize makes image-based copies and removes searchable text and interactive features.

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:23.654
Savings depend on the file.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.106
Your captures stay in this browser.

00:01:26.266 --> 00:01:28.357
Search, reopen, and keep creating.

00:01:28.517 --> 00:01:30.693
Export important files as a backup.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.381
Capture Studio.

00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:33.522
Every pixel.

00:01:33.682 --> 00:01:34.642
All yours.
